<h1
   class="content-page__heading content-page__heading--title col-12 col-md-9 col-lg-7"
  >
            The DART-Europe e-theses portal has closed down
      </h1>
                    
<p  class="content-page__paragraph col-12 col-md-10 col-lg-7">
      Please note that the DART-Europe e-theses portal was closed down permanently on Monday 03 February 2025.
  </p>
          </div>
          




    
<div  class="basic-content component component--inline-link-styles row">
      <div  class="basic-content__column col-12 col-md-9 col-lg-7">
              <p>We would like to thank all our partners and contributors over many years.</p><p>Electronic research theses can be found in several general open access aggregators, below,&nbsp;and in institutions’ individual open access repositories.</p><ul><li><a href="https://base-search.net/" rel="nofollow">BASE</a></li><li><a href="https://core.ac.uk/" rel="nofollow">CORE</a></li><li>NDLTD&nbsp;(<a href="http://search.ndltd.org/" rel="nofollow">Global ETD Search</a> and <a href="https://ndltd.org/thesis-resources/find-etds/" rel="nofollow">Find ETDs</a>)</li></ul><p>The DART-Europe e-theses portal was a searchable database of open access electronic research theses held in European repositories, with links to full text copies.</p>
          </div>
  </div>


  </div>

  </div>

  </div>

    </main>
